  "description": "ASP.NET Core authentication for OrionLedger. An AuthenticationHandler reads the API key from a configurable header, verifies it through OrionLedger (hash lookup, revoked/expired/scope checks, last-used update), and establishes a ClaimsPrincipal carrying the key's subject and scopes. Projects scopes into claims so [Authorize(Policy=...)] and a require-scope helper work with standard ASP.NET Core authorization. Registers through AddAuthentication().AddOrionLedgerApiKey().",
